<div class="cloud-page">
    <!-- Login Cloud -->
    <div class="login-cloud">
        <h1>{{{form_h1}}}</h1>
        <p>{{{form_p}}}</p>

        {{#if error_message}}
            {{#ifNotEquals error_message ""}}
            <div class="error-alert">
                <p>{{error_message}}</p>
                <p>Login failed, please try again!</p>
            </div>
            {{/ifNotEquals}}
        {{/if}}

        <div class="login-content">
            <div class="login-form">
                <form method="post" action="/account/login">
                    <label for="email">Email:</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Email address" required>
                    
                    <label for="password">Password:</label>
                    <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="Password" required>
                    
                    <button type="submit">Sign In</button>
                </form>

                <a href="/account/login/google" class="google-btn">
                    <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/16/000000/google-logo.png" alt="Google"/> 
                    Login with Google
                </a>
                
                <p class="cookie-notice">The admin section of the website uses functional cookies.</p>
                <p class="login-links"><a href="/account/register">Register New Account</a> | <a href="/account/reset-password">Forgot Password?</a></p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="welcome-text">
                <h2>CloudViPER</h2>
                <p>Welcome to our app! Here, we prioritize your privacy and security above all. Feel free to log in and explore our features. Remember, we never share your information with anyone.</p>
                <p>If you encounter any issues while logging in, please contact our support team for assistance. We're here to help you every step of the way.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Information Section -->
    <div class="info-section">
        <div class="info-column">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-cloud" style="color: #87CEEB;"></i> What is CloudViPER?</h3>
            <p>CloudViPER is a powerful cloud-based digital preservation platform that provides automated validation, identification, and characterization of digital files. Built on the robust ViPER framework, it offers seamless access to preservation tools and workflows.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-column">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="color: #137DA4;"></i> Secure & Reliable</h3>
            <p>Your digital assets are protected with enterprise-grade security and privacy controls. All processing happens in isolated, secure environments with comprehensive audit trails and data protection compliance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-column">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-rocket" style="color: #20B2AA;"></i> Get Started</h3>
            <p>Ready to begin your digital preservation journey? Log in to access your dashboard, upload files for analysis, and leverage our comprehensive suite of preservation tools and validation services.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>